Package: dimensionalitytools
Type: Package
Title: Efficient Bifactor Model Indices for Simulation and Applied Use
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("First", "Last", email = "email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes bifactor model indices including ECV, PUC, omega hierarchical,
    omega subscale, omega total, H (construct replicability), factor determinacy (FD),
    Cronbach's alpha, and ARPB. Accepts fitted lavaan or mirt objects, or a raw
    standardized loading matrix. Designed for efficiency in simulation contexts while
    remaining accessible for single-dataset applied use. All indices are computed from
    an extracted loading matrix without refitting models.
